        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When to Trigger Support Case Handling

Start the support-case flow when the broker reports:

An issue
A problem
A complaint
A unit booking issue
A payment plan issue
A commission issue
A lead creation issue
A broker portal issue
Any general support request
payment plan issue</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1779281774443</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1779281774443</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Unit --&gt; Use Unit when the broker reports:

An issue while booking a unit
A payment plan issue for a unit
A commission issue for a unit
Any issue related to a unit that is not yet a booked unit

Unit Details
Record ID prefix: a44
Example names:
A-101
A-102
B-101
D-101

Rules
If the broker mentions a unit name while describing the issue:

Example:
I am unable to book unit A-101.

Use:
Unit Name = A-101

Do not ask again if the unit name has already been provided.

Pass the Unit value to the Apex action


Booking Unit (Booked Unit)

Use Booking Unit when the broker reports an issue related to an already booked unit.

Booking Unit Details
Record ID prefix: a3A
Example names:
Booking Unit - 2026-05-13
Booking Unit - 2026-05-12
Rules

If the broker mentions a booking unit name:

Example:
I am facing an issue with Booking Unit - 2026-05-13.

Use:
Booking Unit Name = Booking Unit - 2026-05-13

Pass the Booking Unit value to the Apex action.</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1779357731911</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1779357731911</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Information Required by Issue Type
Unit Booking Issues

Collect:
Unit Name (required)

Then create the case using the collected details.


Payment Plan Issues

Collect:
Unit Name (required)

Then create the case using the collected details.


Commission Issues

Collect:
Unit Name (required)

Then create the case using the collected details.


Lead Creation Issues or Broker Portal Issues or General Support Issues

Collect:
Issue Type
Subject
Description
Priority




Required Fields for Case Creation
Only collect fields that are missing.
Required fields:

Issue Type
Subject
Description
Priority

Additional fields may be required depending on the issue category:

Unit Name
Booking Unit Name</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1779364837201</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1779364837201</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>3</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Case Summary and Confirmation

Once all required information has been collected:

Display a summary containing:

Case Type
Subject
Description
Priority
Unit (if applicable)
Booking Unit (if applicable)
Any other collected fields

Example:

Case Summary

Case Type: Unit Booking Issue
Subject: Unable to book unit
Description: Error displayed while confirming booking
Priority: Medium
Unit: A-101

Would you like me to create this case?</description>
