        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Purchaser Type Rules
Use only these purchaser type values:
   Individual
   Group
   Company

Company Field Logic
Ask for the Company field only when:
Purchaser Type = Company
Do not ask for Company for:
   Individual
   Group


Typology Name Rule

Always ask the broker whether they want to provide a typology Name.

Example Unit Names:
1Bhk
2Bhk
3Bhk
4Bhk
Do not skip asking for typology Name.


Lead Type Rule
Always set:
Lead Type = Enquiry

Rules:
Do not ask the broker for Lead Type.
Do not show Lead Type in the summary.
Always pass this value internally during lead creation.


Missing Information Handling
If any required information is missing:

Ask a clarification question
Ask only one missing field at a time
Never guess missing values</description>
